<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1335197200"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445400168"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Young and Beautiful"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="手嶌葵"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Cheek to Cheek～I Love Cinemas～"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:37.147"><div begin="00:00.000" end="04:19.404"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:15.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I've seen the world, had it all, had my cake now</p><p begin="00:16.994" end="00:24.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Diamonds, brilliant, and Belair now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">金迷纸醉 杯酌换盏 迷人芬芳</span></p><p begin="00:25.770" end="00:34.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Hot summer nights, mid-July, when you and I were forever wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仲夏夜茫 七月未央</span></p><p begin="00:34.865" end="00:44.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">The crazy days, city lights, the way you'd play with me like a child<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵情时光 华灯初上</span></p><p begin="00:45.486" end="00:53.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Will you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我年华不再 容颜老去</span></p><p begin="00:54.613" end="01:02.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Will you still love me when I've got nothin' but my achin' soul?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我一无所有 遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="01:02.583" end="01:11.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I know you will, I know you will, I know that you will<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深知你会 我深知你会</span></p><p begin="01:11.317" end="01:20.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Will you still love me when I'm no longer beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我容颜老去</span></p><p begin="01:38.695" end="01:46.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I've seen the world, lit it up as my stage now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忆睹寰宇</span></p><p begin="01:47.752" end="01:55.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Channeling angels in the new age now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝代风华 天使脸庞</span></p><p begin="01:56.020" end="02:05.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Hot summer nights, rock 'n' roll, the way you'd play for me at your show<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">白日盛夏 放纵摇摆</span></p><p begin="02:05.673" end="02:14.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">And all the ways I got to know your pretty face and electric soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">精致容颜 魂灵不羁狂妄</span></p><p begin="02:16.189" end="02:24.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Will you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我年华不再 容颜老去</span></p><p begin="02:25.227" end="02:32.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Will you still love me when I've got nothin' but my achin' soul?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我一无所有 遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="02:33.160" end="02:41.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I know you will, I know you will, I know that you will<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深知你会 我深知你会</span></p><p begin="02:41.778" end="02:50.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Will you still love me when I'm no longer beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我容颜老去</span></p><p begin="02:51.810" end="03:00.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Dear, Lord, when I get to Heaven, please let me bring my man<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天父在上 当我去至天堂</span></p><p begin="03:00.776" end="03:08.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">When he comes, tell me that you'll let him, Father, tell me if you can<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与他随行 允他入场</span></p><p begin="03:09.344" end="03:17.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">All that grace, all that body, all that face makes me wanna party<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恩典所赐 诱惑的身材</span></p><p begin="03:18.267" end="03:27.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">He's my sun, he makes me shine like diamonds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他如日光 使我若钻石夺目 璀璨闪亮</span></p><p begin="03:28.388" end="03:36.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">And will you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我年华不再 容颜老去</span></p><p begin="03:37.577" end="03:45.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Will you still love me when I've got nothin' but my achin' soul?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我一无所有 遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="03:45.362" end="03:54.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">I know you will, I know you will, I know that you will<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深知你会 我深知你会</span></p><p begin="03:54.035" end="04:02.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Will you still love me when I'm no longer beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我容颜老去</span></p><p begin="04:03.446" end="04:11.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Will you still love me when I'm no longer beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我容颜老去</span></p><p begin="04:12.427" end="04:19.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Will you still love me when I'm not young and beautiful?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我年华不再 容颜老去</span></p></div></body></tt>